#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:99
msgid ""
"``A0``-``A3`` are **analog-only** pads on the STM32H747 with no GPIO "
"function — treat them as ADC inputs only. ``A2``/``A4`` and ``A3``/``A5`` "
"share their physical pins with ``D10`` and ``D8`` respectively, so you can't"
" drive PWM or SPI on those while reading them as analog. ``A7`` lives on the"
" bottom HD connectors."
msgstr ""
"``A0``-``A3`` 是 STM32H747 上的 **纯模拟** 焊盘，没有 GPIO 功能——只能将它们当作 ADC 输入使用。\\ "
"``A2``/``A4`` 和 ``A3``/``A5`` 分别与 ``D10`` 和 ``D8`` "
"共用物理引脚，因此在将它们读取为模拟量的同时无法在这些引脚上驱动 PWM 或 SPI。\\ ``A7`` 位于底部 HD 连接器上。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:107
msgid "Power pins"
msgstr "电源引脚"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:109
msgid "MKR header pins:"
msgstr "MKR 排针引脚："

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:111
msgid ""
"**VIN** — main system rail into the on‑board PMIC. Fed via a diode from the "
"``+5V`` rail, the MKR ``VIN`` pin, or the bottom 80‑pin HD connectors."
msgstr ""
"**VIN**\\ ——进入板载 PMIC 的主系统电源轨。经过一个二极管由 ``+5V`` 电源轨、MKR 的 ``VIN`` 引脚或底部 80 针 "
"HD 连接器供电。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:114
msgid ""
"**+5V** — 5 V rail fed from USB, the ESLOV connector, or the MKR ``+5V`` pin"
" itself."
msgstr "**+5V**\\ ——5 V 电源轨，由 USB、ESLOV 连接器或 MKR 的 ``+5V`` 引脚本身供电。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:116
msgid "**+3V3** — main 3.3 V rail (PMIC switching regulator output)."
msgstr "**+3V3**\\ ——主 3.3 V 电源轨（PMIC 开关稳压器输出）。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:117
msgid ""
"**AREF** — analog voltage reference for the ADC pins. Defaults to 3.3 V; "
"drive externally to use a different reference."
msgstr "**AREF**\\ ——ADC 引脚的模拟电压基准。默认为 3.3 V；可从外部驱动以使用不同的基准。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:119
msgid "**GND** — common ground."
msgstr "**GND**\\ ——公共地。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:121
msgid "Battery input:"
msgstr "电池输入："

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:123
msgid ""
"**Li‑Po JST** on the front of the board accepts a 3.7 V Li‑Po cell. The PMIC"
" charges it whenever ``+5V`` or ``VIN`` is present."
msgstr ""
"板子前端的 **Li‑Po JST** 接受 3.7 V 锂聚合物电芯。只要存在 ``+5V`` 或 ``VIN``\\ ，PMIC 就会对其充电。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:127
msgid "The Portenta H7 can be powered through any of these paths:"
msgstr "Portenta H7 可以通过以下任一路径供电："

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:129
msgid "**USB‑C** — supplies 5 V to the on‑board PMIC."
msgstr "**USB‑C**\\ ——向板载 PMIC 提供 5 V。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:130
msgid ""
"**ESLOV connector** — up to 5 V on ``VESLOV`` (see :ref:`arduino-"
"portenta-h7-eslov`)."
msgstr ""
"**ESLOV 连接器**\\ ——\\ ``VESLOV`` 上最高 5 V（参见 :ref:`arduino-"
"portenta-h7-eslov`\\ ）。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:132
msgid "**VIN pin** — drive a regulated 5 V supply directly."
msgstr "**VIN 引脚**\\ ——直接驱动一个稳压的 5 V 电源。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:133
msgid "**Li‑Po battery** — connect to the JST on the front."
msgstr "**Li‑Po 电池**\\ ——连接到前端的 JST。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:138
msgid "ESLOV connector"
msgstr "ESLOV 连接器"

