msgstr "恢复与调试引脚"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:165
msgid ""
"**RESET** — both an exposed pin on the top header and a momentary switch on "
"the side of the board, tied to the SoC's NRST line. Pull to GND or press the"
" button to reset."
msgstr ""
"**RESET**\\ ——既是顶部排针上引出的一个引脚，也是板子侧面的一个瞬时开关，连接到 SoC 的 NRST 线。拉到 GND "
"或按下按钮即可复位。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:169
#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:885
msgid ""
"The Portenta H7 uses Arduino's standard **double‑tap reset** to enter "
"Arduino's bootloader. Quickly press the reset button twice — the board "
"re‑enumerates over USB as a DFU device and OpenMV IDE can flash a new "
"firmware image."
msgstr ""
"Portenta H7 使用 Arduino 标准的 **双击复位** 来进入 Arduino 的引导加载程序。快速按两下复位按钮——板子会通过 USB"
" 重新枚举为 DFU 设备，OpenMV IDE 即可烧录新的固件镜像。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:174
msgid "The STM32 SWD signals are exposed on the bottom **HD connector J1**:"
msgstr "STM32 的 SWD 信号引出在底部 **HD 连接器 J1** 上："

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:177
msgid "``J1‑73`` — NRST"
msgstr "``J1‑73``\\ ——NRST"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:178
msgid "``J1‑75`` — SWDIO (PA13)"
msgstr "``J1‑75``\\ ——SWDIO（PA13）"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:179
msgid "``J1‑77`` — SWCLK (PA14)"
msgstr "``J1‑77``\\ ——SWCLK（PA14）"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:180
msgid "``J1‑79`` — SWO (PB3)"
msgstr "``J1‑79``\\ ——SWO（PB3）"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:182
msgid ""
"Wire them up via a Portenta Breakout, the official Arduino debug adapter, or"
" a custom carrier with a 1.27 mm header. All debug signals are **3.3 V "
"referenced**."
msgstr ""
"通过 Portenta Breakout、官方 Arduino 调试适配器或带 1.27 mm 排针的自定义载板将它们连接起来。所有调试信号均为 "
"**3.3 V 基准**\\ 。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:188
msgid ""
"When the **Portenta Vision Shield** is attached, the same SWD/JTAG signals "
"are routed up to the standard **20‑pin ARM Cortex Debug JTAG header** on the"
" shield (1.27 mm / 0.05″ pitch)."
msgstr ""
"当连接了 **Portenta Vision Shield** 时，相同的 SWD/JTAG 信号会被引到该扩展板上标准的 **20 针 ARM "
"Cortex Debug JTAG 排针**\\ （1.27 mm / 0.05″ 间距）。"

