#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:527
msgid "LoRa (Vision Shield)"
msgstr "LoRa（Vision Shield）"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:529
msgid ""
"The **LoRa edition** of the Vision Shield adds a Murata CMWX1ZZABZ LoRaWAN "
"module wired to the Portenta H7 over UART. The ``lora`` module wraps the "
"AT‑command firmware and supports OTAA or ABP join, uplink, and downlink::"
msgstr ""
"Vision Shield 的 **LoRa 版** 增加了一个通过 UART 连接到 Portenta H7 的 Murata CMWX1ZZABZ "
"LoRaWAN 模块。\\ ``lora`` 模块封装了 AT 命令固件，支持 OTAA 或 ABP 入网、上行链路和下行链路::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:559
msgid ""
"Use ``BAND_US915`` / ``BAND_AS923`` / ``BAND_AU915`` etc. for non‑EU "
"regions, and switch to :meth:`lora.Lora.join_ABP` if your network server "
"uses ABP activation."
msgstr ""
"对于非欧盟地区，请使用 ``BAND_US915`` / ``BAND_AS923`` / ``BAND_AU915`` 等；如果你的网络服务器使用 "
"ABP 激活，则切换为 :meth:`lora.Lora.join_ABP`\\ 。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:565
msgid ""
"While the LoRa module is in use, the driver claims the following MKR header "
